# Recombinant Chromosomes

@left

![Recombinant chromosomes](repo:prototype/assets/lect06c-meiosis/recombinant_chromosomes.svg)

@right

Nonsister chromatids held together during synapsis:

1. Synapsis and crossing over
2. Movement to the metaphase I plate
3. Breakdown of proteins holding sister chromatid arms together

